        <activityName xml:lang="en">Acrylonitrile-butadiene-styrene copolymer, ABS, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Acrylonitrile-butadiene-styrene copolymer, ABS, at plant
Data are from the Eco-profiles of the European plastics industry (PlasticsEurope). Not included are the values reported for: recyclable wastes, amount of air / N2 / O2 consumed, unspecified metal emission to air and to water, mercaptan emission to air, unspecified CFC/HCFC emission to air, dioxin to water. The amount of "sulphur (bonded)" is assumed to be included into the amount of raw oil.;
CAS number: 009003-56-9; 
UUID: dad0fc14-f7f9-3292-8754-ac91fe7c2825
Aggregated data for all processes from raw material extraction until delivery at plant
Location: 7 European production sites
Technology: production by emulsion polymerization out of its three monomers
Time period: time to which data refer
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature values based on company survey 
Extrapolations: no extrapolation
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_dad0fc14-f7f9-3292-8754-ac91fe7c2825.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
